    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to find the point in it all. i used to be so active, so useful. now i'm just a burden to the doctors and the people checking in on me. it feels like i've lost my dignity, you know? like i'm just waiting for a permission slip to finally stop struggling.",
